{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790343180, "covers_from": "2026-09-25T13:33:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-25T13:34:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790343240, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-25T13:33:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "queue_number": 51687, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "如果，你擔任市長，勞工退休金會依據勞基法辦理嗎？\n如果，沒有！\n勞工該怎麼辦？", "display_name": "文山代表 No.51,687", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T13:33:12+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 5678, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "處理慶城街長春路口的廢棄大樓，那裡會是治安死角", "display_name": "松山代表 No.5,678", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T13:33:20+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 22088, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "環境", "content": "我每天走路上下班都會遇到有人邊走邊抽煙\n真的很氣又恨困擾 躲都躲不掉", "display_name": "信義代表 Olliẽ", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T13:33:31+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 24167, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "交通", "content": "可否有比較不容易造成打滑的路面標線？\n下雨天騎車總是膽戰心驚，怕壓到標線打滑造成事故", "display_name": "南港代表 No.24,167", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T13:33:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 10039, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "為什麼台北市今年會ㄧ直砍樹，而且都砍到什麽都沒留或只剩下當成凳子，不聽聽市民的聲音嗎？", "display_name": "大安代表 李鈺宸(Amou Lee)", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 5678, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.5,678", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 22088, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "display_name": "信義代表 Olliẽ", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true,